I can understand if some people prefer to use the amulet of ESP but
personally I am not convinced that it would enhance my chances of
winning in mid-late game enough over my preferred AoR + robe + GDSM or
AoLS + CoMR + SDSM combos to make it worth it. The warning intrinsic
(or ring, though I wouldn't waste a ring slot on this personally) and
the detect monsters spell can provide substantially equivalent
information, and work even for monsters that don't have brains. But I
didn't even start using the spell until my most recent game, where I
got bored playing extinctionist-style and have decided to merely wipe
out the remaining existing monsters in the dungeon before
ascending :-)

Regardless, I recognize that my equipment preferences are partly due
to my preferred playstyle: not wishing for quest artifacts, and
spellcasting even for fighter roles. If that's "playing with one hand
tied behind my back", so be it; I did state that this is my playstyle
and preference. I would be curious to see how many serial ascenders
rely on the amulet of ESP as part of their kit, however...

